• Travel Date: 
• Pickup Time: 
• Pickup Area (Chennai): 
• Vehicle Preference: [Sedan / Ertiga / Innova / Crysta / Tempo]
• Passengers: 

Please share availability and confirmed quote.`
  },
  {
    id: "yercaud",
    name: "Chennai to Yercaud Hill Station (Shevaroy Range)",
    duration: "2–3 Days (720 km Round Trip)",
    badge: "Coffee Plantation Hills",
    slug: "yercaud-hills-weekend",
