    rates: createPackageRates(["₹11,500", "₹14,000", "₹16,800", "₹19,500", "₹24,000"]),
    highlights: "Emerald Lake, Lady's Seat & Pagoda Point viewpoints, Killiyur Falls, botanical garden & aromatic coffee plantation walks. Hill road experienced drivers.",
    whatsappMsg: `*Kalidass Travels - Yercaud Hills Enquiry*
• Tour: Chennai to Yercaud Hill Station (2-3 Days)
• Travel Date: 
